      "name": "Tile Array",
      "maker": "KELDER AUDIO WORKS",
      "purpose": "A native drum rack with empty/default sample slots.",
      "description": "A sixteen-pad one-shot drum instrument. Import an isolated hit or request three local candidates for one pad, audition and keep one without disturbing its neighbours. Trim, tune, shape the attack and decay, assign notes and choke groups. Kit level and pan stay immediately available; source generation is optional and saved kits play offline.",
      "role": "synth",
      "tags": [
        "drums",
        "sampler"
      ]
